1
00:00:00,153 --> 00:00:03,833
(Penny:)Almost as dirty as the dirty girl
who's wearing them.

2
00:00:06,359 --> 00:00:07,169
(Penny:)Okay, that's enough.

3
00:00:07,293 --> 00:00:09,833
(Leonard:)-Disagree.
-Keep going.

4
00:00:12,131 --> 00:00:14,201
(Penny:)So, what do you think?

5
00:00:15,701 --> 00:00:19,171
(Sheldon:)A tad asymmetrical,
but nothing to be concerned about.

6
00:00:20,807 --> 00:00:22,717
(Penny:)Please, Sheldon. I need you.

7
00:00:23,709 --> 00:00:26,089
To. .. what?

8
00:00:27,013 --> 00:00:28,183
(Penny:)To take me.

9
00:00:28,314 --> 00:00:31,224
(Sheldon:)I'm not taking you anywhere
till you put on a shirt.

10
00:00:33,853 --> 00:00:36,263
(Penny:)Come on, Sheldon.
You and me right here.

11
00:00:36,422 --> 00:00:38,922
(Sheldon:)Penny, for the thousandth time,

12
00:00:39,091 --> 00:00:42,091
(Sheldon:)I'm saving myself
for someone special.

13
00:00:42,261 --> 00:00:45,901
(Sheldon:)Perhaps a cute
bespectacled neuroscientist

14
00:00:46,032 --> 00:00:48,872
(Sheldon:)with hair the color of mud.

15
00:00:50,169 --> 00:00:52,079
(Penny:)I think I know how
to change your mind.

16
00:00:53,773 --> 00:00:55,113
(Penny:)-That's enough.

17
00:00:56,375 --> 00:01:03,025
(Stuart:)I was okay with it.

